    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπάλᾰμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>handy, skilful, ingenious</i>, of persons, Phoronis
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.216
			</span></i>, al.: more freq. in the abstract, <i>inventive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέριμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1531
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					58.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.967
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>skilfully wrought</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕμνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				17.146
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>easily manipulated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				60.47
			</span></i>.</div>
